            <div type="edition" xml:id="div2LIT7935HmamaKabed">
                <note>The following incipit is taken from the manuscript <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/BAVet220">Vatican City, Biblioteca Apostolica Vaticana, Aeth. 220</ref>
                    according to the catalogue description in 
                    <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/QZH8VYBF"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices"/><title level="m">Bybliothecae apostolicae Vaticanae codices manu scripti recensiti iussu Pii XI Pontificis maximi. Codices Aethiopici Vaticani et Borgiani, Barberinianus orientalis 2, Rossianus 865&lt;hi rend="italics"&gt;, I:&lt;/hi&gt; Enarratio codicum</title><author><forename>Sylvain</forename><surname>Grébaut</surname></author><author><forename>Eugène</forename><surname>Tisserant</surname></author><pubPlace>Città del Vaticano</pubPlace><publisher>In Bybliotheca Vaticana</publisher><date>1935</date><note type="tags"><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:GrebTiss1935Codices</note></note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:GrebTiss1935Codices</note><citedRange unit="page">692</citedRange></bibl> .</note>
                <ab>በስመ፡ አብ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices"/> ጸሎት፡ በእንተ፡ ሕማመ፡ <choice resp="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices">
                        <sic>ክበድ፡</sic>
                        <corr>ከብድ፡</corr>
                    </choice> ይትባረክ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ አምላክ፡ አናንያ፡ ወአዛርያ፡ ወሚሳኤል፡ እም<supplied reason="omitted" resp="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices">እ</supplied>ቶነ፡
                    እሳት፡ ዘይነድድ፡ በኂሩትከ፡ ይትመየጥ፡ ወይሰሰል፡ ዝንቱ፡ ሕማመ፡ <choice resp="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices">
                        <sic>ክበድ፡</sic>
                        <corr>ከብድ፡</corr>
                    </choice>
                    <choice resp="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices">
                        <sic>አድኅኖ</sic>
                        <corr>አድኅና</corr>
                    </choice>፨ ለዓመትከ፡ <supplied reason="omitted" resp="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices">ወለተ፡</supplied> ገብርኤል፡
                </ab>
            </div>
            <div type="edition" xml:id="div3LIT7935HmamaKabed">
                <note>The following incipit is taken from the manuscript <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/EMIP00292#ms_i1.2.6">Portland, Ethiopic Manuscript Imaging Project, Shover Codex 1: ʾAsmāt-prayer (general record) (in ms_i1.2.6)</ref>.</note>
                <ab>ጸሎት፡ በእንተ፡ ሕማመ፡ ከብድ፡ አምላከ፡ አብርሃም፡ በውስተ፡ በዓታት፡ አምላከ፡ አናንያ፡ ወአዛርያ፡ ወሚሳኤል፡ በውስተ፡ እቶነ፡ እሳት፡<gap reason="ellipsis"/>
